{
 "encounter_id": "00788",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Doctor, my cholesterol is still high, even though I've changed my diet completely, and the tablet, and now I get this tightness in my chest when I walk fast, and my wife says come, so I came."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Take me through the tightness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's like a band across the middle. When I walk fast up the road to the temple. It started two months ago. Oh, and last week I was at my nephew's wedding, such a grand affair..."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Mm. What happens when you stop walking? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It goes away in a few minutes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any breathlessness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "On hills, yes, I'm puffing."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How's your energy?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Tired. Every afternoon, I feel like a wet cloth."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything in your legs?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Calf cramps at night, sometimes. Both sides."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does the chest tightness come when you're resting?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, never at rest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Palpitations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, no palpitations."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fainting?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Never fainted, doctor."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Which tablets?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Atorvastatin, 20 mg, at night. And aspirin, 75 mg, once a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin, as a baby. My mother said I came out in a rash. I've never taken it since."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What conditions do you have?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High cholesterol, pre-diabetes, a fatty liver, and gout in the big toe."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Surgery?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My appendix as a teenager, and a knee arthroscopy in 2016."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Heart problems in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father had a heart attack at fifty-two. And my brother has high cholesterol too."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Tell me about your diet."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No meat, I'm vegetarian. But fried snacks, sweets, ghee, I admit it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I've never smoked in my life."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Exercise?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I walk twenty minutes a day, that's all."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check you. Pulse 76, blood pressure 138 over 86, temperature 36.6, oxygen 98 percent, breathing 16, weight 88 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is the pressure all right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "A little high. Let me listen to your heart.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Heart sounds are normal, no murmurs."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank God. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I can feel the pulses at your ankles, but the right one is weaker than the left."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is that bad? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your breathing at rest?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing at rest."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your cholesterol may run in the family, which would explain why diet isn't enough. But the chest tightness on walking could mean narrowed heart arteries, and I can't rule that out."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh my God. Is it serious? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It needs checking, that's all. I'd like to arrange a fasting cholesterol blood test, an ECG, and an exercise stress test."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "The ECG today, the stress test this month. Keep taking the aspirin. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, doctor. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in three weeks, with the results."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three weeks. Thank you. ~"
  }
 ],
